WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.760
Meet Dharma AI, a local book knowledge assistant.

2
00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.513
Upload a PDF to begin.

3
00:00:07.513 --> 00:00:15.026
The app extracts text, creates overlapping chunks, and generates embeddings with Ollama.

4
00:00:15.026 --> 00:00:19.144
Once indexed, ask a question about the book.

5
00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:26.381
Dharma AI retrieves relevant passages and generates an answer grounded in the document.

6
00:00:26.381 --> 00:00:31.118
Here, it correctly identifies the five Pandava brothers.

7
00:00:31.118 --> 00:00:35.460
Expand View Sources to inspect the supporting text.

8
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:39.000
Audio controls let you hear the answer.

9
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.263
An unrelated recipe question is rejected, rather than answered from general knowledge.

10
00:00:46.263 --> 00:00:53.289
Voice input and spoken answers were also tested successfully by the project owner.

11
00:00:53.289 --> 00:01:00.000
This recorded walkthrough stays available even when the optional local demo is offline.
